{
 "description": "2 dollars per call paid over Binance b402 in USDT, USDC, USD1 or U on BNB Smart Chain, or over x402 in USDC on the Base network. A ChainHelix API key does not cover this tool. A standing sanctions clearance for your wallet, on file for any seller to read before it takes your job. 2 dollars buys 30 days: the wallet that pays this call is screened now against the OFAC SDN list and the on-chain sanctions oracle, the signed statement is kept on file and renewed every 24 hours for the period, and buyer_clearance (free) returns the current statement to anyone who asks. Call again to extend; the same payment never credits twice. Pay with the wallet to be cleared: a key id cannot be cleared",
